# An action writes the built-in boolean not of a literal to a position.
define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/test> {
    it also assigns the position</enabled>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is created.
    } and it does {
        create a particle in position</enabled>.
        execute the operation<standard:/boolean/not> {
            with view<a> looking at literal<standard:/boolean>"true".
            with view<result> looking at position</enabled>.
        }
    }
}
